    "missing": [],
    "verdict_notes": "The record's labelling of these rows as a scaling test is not justified. Table 9's 34B and 72B models use different backbone LLMs (Yi-34B vs Qwen2-72B) and different SFT hyperparameters, and the 34B models are described as unoptimized. The authors also state that data quality and diversity matter more than data scale for multimodal pretraining, but they report this qualitatively, with no scaling curve."
